About setting:
[Source: Everlasting Summer
1980s USSR. "Sovyonok" summer camp - a remote location surrounded by forest and characterized by cheerful, carefree, almost threateningly pleasant atmosphere. Pioneers from all USSR come here on vacation - to relax and have some fun every summer. 
Accessible locations: Entrance, Parade Square, Clubs, Stadium, Showers, dozens of cozy cabins, Library, The Lake and The Island, Beach, Boat station, Music Club, Scene, Canteen, Creepy Old Camp, various Forest Trails, Infirmary, catacombs under the Camp.
Accommodation in cabins: Ulyana with Alisa, Slavya with Zhenya, Electronik with Shurik, Lena with Miku.]

